<title>USA: ITT confirms Alcatel stake sale.</title>
<headline>ITT confirms Alcatel stake sale.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>ITT Corp confirmed it sold three million shares in French telecommunications firm Alcatel Alsthom to a U.S. investment firm.</p>
<p>The company, which confirmed an earlier statement from Alcatel in Paris, declined to elaborate.</p>
<p>After the transaction, ITT holds a 2.8 percent stake in Alcatel.</p>
<p>ITT had said it planned to sell non-core assets as it attempted to thwart a hostile takeover bid from Hilton Hotels Corp.</p>
<p>((--Robin Sidel, 212/859-1723))</p>
